This work as a whole is licensed under
[Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0).

Parts of this work which do not make a user-flyable model of Tu-144D
for FlightGear can be redistributed under
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0).
For example, such models can be distributed under CC-BY:

 - a working model of Tu-144 (but not Tu-144D) or another aircraft
   based on this model;
 - a port of the model to a simulator unrelated to FlightGear;
 - systems, instruments, scripts;
 - 3D model for AI, scenery model (that is, not functioning as
   aircraft model);
 - 3D models of indicators and panels;
 - etc.,

but any model of Tu-144D the user can fly in FlightGear that is based
on this one must be distributed under CC-BY-SA.

Permissions beyond the scope of this license may be available by
contacting the authors.


Inactivity fallback
-------------------

The above restrictions no longer apply, and the whole work is
available under
[CC0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0)
if all of the following conditions are met:

- **365 days** have passed without development activity in any of the
  projects in GitLab subgroup
  [fg_shfsn/tu-144d](https://gitlab.com/fg_shfsn/tu-144d "Project gitlab group")
  by the members having write access to those projects' repositories;
- attempts to contact all of the said members on all known channels,
  including outside of GitLab, have been exhausted without any
  relevant and meaningful response to questions about the projects.


