Affiliation and trademarks
--------------------------

1. The authors are not affiliated with any organizations that may be
mentioned throughout this work.
2. The listed or any other trademarks and technical detail used in
this work belong to their respective owners and are used by
the authors only to reflect the reality:
    1. Design and exterior of the Tu-144 and Tu-154 aircraft families
       are the property of Joint Stock Company Tupolev. The "Tu" and
       "Tu-144 trademarks and their respective logos are the
       trademarks of [Joint Stock Company Tupolev](https://tupolev.ru)
    2. Design and performance data of RD-36 engines are the property
       of [UEC NPO Saturn, PJSC](https://npo-saturn.ru)
    3. Design and performance data of NK-144 and NK-32 engines are the
       property of [UEC Kuznetsov, PJSC](http://kuznetsov-motors.ru/)
    4. Design of the USSR Aeroflot livery and Aeroflot logo are the
       property of [PJSC Aeroflot](https://aeroflot.ru)
